WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.421
Spring is beginning.

2
00:00:03.422 --> 00:00:05.405
I open the window.

3
00:00:05.406 --> 00:00:08.845
The air is fresh.

4
00:00:08.846 --> 00:00:13.082
The animals are waking up.

5
00:00:13.083 --> 00:00:15.958
I watch the animals.

6
00:00:15.959 --> 00:00:19.699
They stretch and yawn.

7
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.433
The flowers are blooming.

8
00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:25.132
I smell the flowers.

9
00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:27.550
They smell good.

10
00:00:27.551 --> 00:00:30.163
The grass is growing.

11
00:00:30.164 --> 00:00:32.401
I look at the grass.

12
00:00:32.402 --> 00:00:35.382
It is so green.

13
00:00:35.383 --> 00:00:38.047
The birds are singing.

14
00:00:38.048 --> 00:00:40.971
I listen to the birds.

15
00:00:40.972 --> 00:00:43.514
They are in their nest.

16
00:00:43.515 --> 00:00:46.217
My friends are waving.

17
00:00:46.218 --> 00:00:48.161
I wave too.

18
00:00:48.162 --> 00:00:50.753
I think about picnics.

19
00:00:50.754 --> 00:00:53.257
My friends are sitting.

20
00:00:53.258 --> 00:00:55.209
I lie down.

21
00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:58.403
We feel the cool breeze.

22
00:00:58.404 --> 00:01:00.718
It is raining!

23
00:01:00.719 --> 00:01:02.399
We get wet!

24
00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:11.063
We say goodbye and run home.

